! Shared X11 defaults. Personal ~/.Xresources is merged afterward.
XTerm*background: #000000
XTerm*foreground: #eeeeee
XTerm*cursorColor: #ffffff
XTerm*pointerColor: #eeeeee
XTerm*pointerColorBackground: #000000
XTerm*highlightColor: #333333
XTerm*highlightTextColor: #ffffff
XTerm*faceName: DejaVu Sans Mono
XTerm*faceSize: 10
XTerm*colorBD: #ffffff
XTerm*colorUL: #cccccc
! Keep ANSI semantic colors readable; the normal terminal surface is black.
XTerm*color0: #000000
XTerm*color7: #dddddd
XTerm*color8: #777777
XTerm*color15: #ffffff
Xmessage*background: #000000
Xmessage*foreground: #eeeeee
Xmessage*form.background: #000000
Xmessage*message.background: #000000
Xmessage*message.foreground: #eeeeee
Xmessage*Command.background: #161616
Xmessage*Command.foreground: #eeeeee
